The  driver provides support for the following Workbit Bus‐Master
CardBus IDE controller chips: CardBus / PCMCIA dual mode IDE con‐
troller This controller is mainly used for portable drives.  This
driver supports the CardBus mode.  CardBus IDE controller.   This
controller  is  widely  used  for  CardBus CompactFlash adapters.
These controllers are capable of bus‐mastering for ATA PIO trans‐
fer.  The driver  uses  the  bus‐mastering  PIO  transfer  unless
transfer buffer is unaligned, and significantly reduces CPU usage
for  PIO‐only  ATA devices compared with usual PIO transfer.  The
optional flags parameter is the value for  ATA  transfers.   Some
combinations  of host and device may fail without flags parameter
or In this case try adding wait values like or (the wait  parame‐
ter is composed of two 4‐bit values).  Smaller wait values should
be faster.  Too long waits may cause transfer errors.  The device
